{"id":"NCT07052903","title":"TRITON-CM: A Study to Evaluate Nucresiran in Patients With Transthyretin Amyloidosis With Cardiomyopathy","official":"TRITON-CM: A Phase 3 Global, Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled Study to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of Nucresiran in Patients With Transthyretin-Mediated Amyloidosis With Cardiomyopathy (ATTR Amyloidosis With Cardiomyopathy)","summary":"The purpose of this study is to:\n\n* Evaluate the efficacy of nucresiran compared to placebo on reducing all-cause mortality and cardiovascular (CV) events\n* Evaluate the efficacy of nucresiran compared to placebo on additional assessments of CV events and/or death\n* Evaluate the efficacy of nucresiran compared to placebo on patient-reported health status and health-related quality of life","conditions":["Transthyretin Amyloidosis With Cardiomyopathy"],"interventions":[{"type":"DRUG","name":"Nucresiran"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"Sterile Normal Saline (0.9% NaCl)"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria\n\n* Has documented diagnosis of ATTR amyloidosis with cardiomyopathy including those with hereditary ATTR (hATTR) or wild-type ATTR (wATTR) amyloidosis.\n* Has medical history of heart failure (HF) with at least 1 prior hospitalization for HF or signs and symptoms that require treatment with a diuretic.\n* Has screening N-terminal prohormone B-type natriuretic peptide (NT-proBNP) \\>300 ng/L and \\<8500 ng/L; In patients with permanent or persistent atrial fibrillation, screening NT-proBNP \\>600 ng/L and \\<8500 ng/L.\n* Patients may be receiving approved TTR stabilizers for ATTR amyloidosis (eg, tafamidis, acoramidis) and may be receiving background therapy for HF at the discretion of the Investigator.\n\nExclusion Criteria\n\n* Has New York Heart Association (NYHA) Class IV HF; or NYHA Class III heart failure AND ATTR Amyloidosis Disease Stage 3.\n* Has a polyneuropathy disability (PND) Score IIIa, IIIb, or IV.\n* Has an estimated glomerular filtration rate (eGFR) of \\<30 mL/min/1.73m\\^2 at screening.\n* Has received prior or currently receiving TTR-lowering therapy","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"85 Years","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"TREATMENT","enrollment":1750,"start":"2025-07-02","pcd":"2030-05-28","upd":"2026-10-20","sponsor":"Alnylam Pharmaceuticals","areas":["other","rare"],"central":["Clinical Trial Information Line · 1-877-ALNYLAM · clinicaltrials@alnylam.com","Clinical Trial Information Line · 1-877-256-9526 · clinicaltrials@alnylam.com"],"sites":[{"f":"Clinical Trial Site","city":"La Jolla","pr":"California","zip":"92037","s":"R","lat":32.8473,"lon":-117.2742,"c":""},{"f":"Clinical Trial Site","city":"Laguna Hills","pr":"California","zip":"92653","s":"R","lat":33.6125,"lon":-117.7128,"c":""},{"f":"Clinical Trial Site","city":"Stanford","pr":"California","zip":"94305","s":"R","lat":37.4241,"lon":-122.1661,"c":""},{"f":"Clinical Trial Site","city":"Aurora","pr":"Colorado","zip":"80045","s":"R","lat":39.7294,"lon":-104.8319,"c":""},{"f":"Clinical Trial Site","city":"Norwich","pr":"Connecticut","zip":"06360","s":"R","lat":41.5243,"lon":-72.0759,"c":""},{"f":"Clinical Trial Site","city":"Washington D.C.","pr":"District of Columbia","zip":"20010","s":"R","lat":38.8951,"lon":-77.0364,"c":""},{"f":"Clinical Trial Site","city":"Brandon","pr":"Florida","zip":"33511","s":"R","lat":27.9378,"lon":-82.2859,"c":""},{"f":"Clinical Trial Site","city":"Miami","pr":"Florida","zip":"33125","s":"R","lat":25.7743,"lon":-80.1937,"c":""},{"f":"Clinical Trial Site","city":"Atlanta","pr":"Georgia","zip":"30309","s":"R","lat":33.749,"lon":-84.388,"c":""},{"f":"Clinical Trial Site","city":"Gainesville","pr":"Georgia","zip":"30501","s":"R","lat":34.2979,"lon":-83.8241,"c":""},{"f":"Clinical Trial Site","city":"Tucker","pr":"Georgia","zip":"30084","s":"R","lat":33.8546,"lon":-84.2171,"c":""},{"f":"Clinical Trial Site","city":"Chicago","pr":"Illinois","zip":"60612","s":"R","lat":41.85,"lon":-87.65,"c":""},{"f":"Clinic